title: "cfd-heat-transfer: Verified Finite-Difference Solvers for Classical Fluid Mechanics and Heat Transfer Problems"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Hosseini"
    given-names: "Amin"
    email: "amin.hosseini1@aut.ac.ir"
    affiliation: "Amirkabir University of Technology (Tehran Polytechnic)"
